{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在音乐细节和感受的细腻程度上明显不如X，尤其是分时出现的音乐变化、声部动态和情绪微妙转折，X提供了更丰富具体的体验。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"作为没有读过原文的普通观众，Y用完整、自然的叙述把人物每一步的心理动机和前后变化交代清楚，尤其能理解他为什么想靠近、为什么害怕、为什么反复收住，以及最后为什么不再要求保证。X的重点高亮和分时感受更容易扫到音乐瞬间，也更细腻，但大量意象和感受碎片容易让注意力分散，有时能感受到很多东西，却不容易马上明白这些东西如何构成一个完整的心理过程。综合而言，我更愿意选择Y，因为理解人物和跟上整段情绪发展，比获得更多局部感受更重要。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d85ff249-eefa-47c5-aac1-2a6ad9192887", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T153334452003Z", "elapsed_seconds": 35.516, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T15:34:09.979329+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d88ff9f3e804df125591f56416ad51fbc408702b7a621d4fd25644276d45bd5e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222